rooms_desc ({"This is the front yard of Albert and Woody's house...It is quite beautiful...all white with a huge porch in front...The house is situated on a high cliff overlooking the AtlanticOcean.  Cool sea air blows in your face as you turn to look atteh VIEW.   At the edge of the cliff is an elevator leading to adock below.  This is where Albert and Woody keep their BOAT...They really, really love their sailboat!!! You can see thewaves rock it back and forth.  Maybe if you ask nicely, theywill take you out for a sail?To the west is a large GARDEN and to the south is a drive-way where Albert and Woody park their CARS.Albert and Woody are gracious hosts and hope you enjoy yourstay in their lovely home...","This is the porch to Albert's house...It is very large with a lot of white wicker furniture.You can see the OCEAN to the east and the garden to the west.  The front door is open as usual.  There is a MAILBOX fastened to one of the posts  Inside is a NEWSPAPER.	A wicker chair.	A Big wicker sofa.	A small wicker table.","This is the foyer...To the east is a sitting room where you can go and chatand have a few drinks.  To the east is a small art gallery.Up ahead north is a hallway.  There are places here to hang up your coats and wipe your feet.	A large grandfather CLOCK.	A small MAT.	A PAINTING.","This is the sitting room.  There are huge bay WINDOWS on the south walland a FIREPLACE to the east.  To the north is a door to Albert's study.  Thereis also a large BAR, stocked with BEER, WINE, ALCOHOL and OTHER drinks.Above the fireplace is a PICTURE.	A plush SOFA	A big CHAIR","This is a small art gallery.  Albert really likes art.He got many of these from the Metropolitan Museum ofArt in New York City....when he bought the place.There are works here by many of the great masters, suchas MONET, PICASSO, DAVID, DAVINCI, DEGAS, andSERAUT.Take a look around!There is a door to the garden to the west.","You are now in a beautiful garden...you areoverpowered by the sweet scents of the flowers,as well as by there bright colours...You think you could spend a good deal of timehere.  It is a very peaceful place.	A huge APPLE tree.	A large ROSE bush.	Other assorted FLORA.	A large BENCH.","This is hallway in Albert's house.There is a deck out the back door to the north.To the west is the door to Albert's bedroom. Onlya priviledged few have been in there.","This is the deck to Albert's  house...You can see the SEA from here...it looks beautiful...Here he likes to have Barbeque's in the summer with his many friends... Other times he just sits out here and looks at the STARS...You think this must be a wonderful place to spend a summer day...And an even better place to spend a warm summer evening...A barbeque GRILL      A bug ZAPPER            A big wicker CHAIR      A huge Hot TUB","This is Albert's bedroom.  It is a fairly large room...worthy of a man of Albert's stature.  There is a BALCONY over-looking the garden, and many pieces of furniture.  There is also a walk-in closet, full ofAlbert's clothes.  He has alot of clothes        A big BED.        A BUREAU.        A PHOTO on Albert's nightable.        A framed Sigma Nu Initiation Certificate.","This is Albert's study.  Here he makes many important decisions that affectall of Geneseo.	DESK	BOOKSHELVES	COMPUTER",})
